<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Pagination on Happy</title><link>/tags/pagination/</link><description>Recent content in Pagination on Happy</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>code4happy@gmail.com (happy-v587)</managingEditor><webMaster>code4happy@gmail.com (happy-v587)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Tue, 16 Mar 2021 13:14:07 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="/tags/pagination/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>mysql limit offset 原理分析与使用</title><link>/mysql-limit-offset-yuan-li-fen-xi-yu-shi-yong/</link><pubDate>Tue, 16 Mar 2021 13:14:07 +0800</pubDate><author>code4happy@gmail.com (happy-v587)</author><guid>/mysql-limit-offset-yuan-li-fen-xi-yu-shi-yong/</guid><description>
 &lt;blockquote&gt;
 &lt;p&gt;本文由原作者归档自 CSDN，原文发布于 2021-03-16。原文链接：&lt;a class="link" href="https://blog.csdn.net/LIUHUAN0520/article/details/114869738" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
 &gt;mysql limit offset 原理分析与使用&lt;/a&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;

 &lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h2 id="背景"&gt;背景
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;一个行数为4亿条的表。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="图 1" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="1981px" data-flex-grow="825" height="255" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="/mysql-limit-offset-yuan-li-fen-xi-yu-shi-yong/img-01.png" srcset="/mysql-limit-offset-yuan-li-fen-xi-yu-shi-yong/img-01_hu_4fa32eb7c9d37686.png 800w, /mysql-limit-offset-yuan-li-fen-xi-yu-shi-yong/img-01_hu_1110ddd832552cda.png 1600w, /mysql-limit-offset-yuan-li-fen-xi-yu-shi-yong/img-01.png 2105w" width="2105"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;查询50000000~50000010行之间的数据。发现查询时间达到20s！！！&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="图 2" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="492px" data-flex-grow="205" height="280" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="/mysql-limit-offset-yuan-li-fen-xi-yu-shi-yong/img-02.png" width="574"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;查询执行计划发现，需要进行全表扫描，没有索引。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="图 3" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="1941px" data-flex-grow="808" height="124" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="/mysql-limit-offset-yuan-li-fen-xi-yu-shi-yong/img-03.png" srcset="/mysql-limit-offset-yuan-li-fen-xi-yu-shi-yong/img-03_hu_e141ea0859087927.png 800w, /mysql-limit-offset-yuan-li-fen-xi-yu-shi-yong/img-03.png 1003w" width="1003"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;但是，sbtest1这个表是有索引的&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="图 4" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="623px" data-flex-grow="259" height="216" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="/mysql-limit-offset-yuan-li-fen-xi-yu-shi-yong/img-04.png" width="561"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;为什么mysql没有选择索引，而是全表扫描呢？&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="分析"&gt;分析
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="mysql-select-语法"&gt;mysql select 语法
